  "title": "Grilled Flank Steak",
  "description": "This grilled flank steak recipe is marinated in a blend of seasonings, oil, and lemon juice for tons of savory flavor. Serve with salad and vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "Dianne Corbett Balach"
  ],
